break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪人はなぜ走るのかMV"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公開されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46が学校内で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サッカーしてるぞ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/08/5394515/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"FIFA U-20女子ワールドカップの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テーマソングです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/08/5394515/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ、載せたっけ⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"載せてないか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/08/5394515/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイブームは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーの髪の毛で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鼻こちょこちょすることです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやがられる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/08/5394515/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、みんなの髪触るのすきなの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ははははは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/08/5394515/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type